1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:02,038
Setiap hari ribuan kendaraan

2
00:00:02,058 --> 00:00:04,468
melintas di atas jembatan.

3
00:00:04,488 --> 00:00:05,939
Tetapi bagaimana struktur ini

4
00:00:05,959 --> 00:00:07,177
bisa menahan beban begitu

5
00:00:07,197 --> 00:00:07,853
besar?

6
00:00:07,873 --> 00:00:09,742
Rahasianya bukan sekadar kuat,

7
00:00:09,762 --> 00:00:11,243
tapi tahu ke mana beban harus

8
00:00:11,263 --> 00:00:11,870
pergi.

9
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,403
Ada beban mati,

10
00:00:13,423 --> 00:00:14,549
yaitu berat jembatan itu

11
00:00:14,569 --> 00:00:15,267
sendiri.

12
00:00:15,287 --> 00:00:16,637
Dan beban hidup:

13
00:00:16,657 --> 00:00:18,108
kendaraan dan manusia yang

14
00:00:18,128 --> 00:00:19,572
berubah setiap saat.

15
00:00:19,592 --> 00:00:20,950
Beban itu menjadi dua gaya

16
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:21,619
utama.

17
00:00:21,639 --> 00:00:23,552
Tekan, yang memampatkan.

18
00:00:23,572 --> 00:00:25,279
Tarik, yang meregangkan.

19
00:00:25,299 --> 00:00:26,575
Saat dek melengkung,

20
00:00:26,595 --> 00:00:28,212
muncul juga gaya geser dan

21
00:00:28,232 --> 00:00:29,371
momen lentur.

22
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:30,842
Karena itu bentuk jembatan

23
00:00:30,862 --> 00:00:31,845
berbeda-beda.

24
00:00:31,865 --> 00:00:32,959
Balok menyalurkan berat ke

25
00:00:32,979 --> 00:00:33,667
pilar.

26
00:00:33,687 --> 00:00:34,859
Rangka segitiga membaginya ke

27
00:00:34,879 --> 00:00:36,053
batang tekan dan tarik.

28
00:00:36,073 --> 00:00:37,276
Lengkung mendorong gaya tekan

29
00:00:37,296 --> 00:00:38,242
ke kedua tumpuan.

30
00:00:38,262 --> 00:00:40,614
Bentang panjang memakai kabel.

31
00:00:40,634 --> 00:00:42,302
Jembatan gantung

32
00:00:42,322 --> 00:00:43,525
menggantungkan dek pada kabel

33
00:00:43,545 --> 00:00:44,732
utama yang diangkur di kedua

34
00:00:44,752 --> 00:00:45,446
ujung.

35
00:00:45,466 --> 00:00:47,653
Jembatan kabel-tetap menarik

36
00:00:47,673 --> 00:00:49,216
dek langsung dari pilon,

37
00:00:49,236 --> 00:00:50,317
seperti Suramadu.

38
00:00:50,337 --> 00:00:51,840
Ikuti satu truk.

39
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,079
Beratnya turun ke dek dan

40
00:00:53,099 --> 00:00:53,974
gelagar.

41
00:00:53,994 --> 00:00:55,757
Kabel menarik dek ke atas.

42
00:00:55,777 --> 00:00:57,181
Pilon menerima gaya itu

43
00:00:57,201 --> 00:00:58,017
sebagai tekan,

44
00:00:58,037 --> 00:00:59,691
lalu meneruskannya ke fondasi,

45
00:00:59,711 --> 00:01:00,564
sampai ke tanah.

46
00:01:00,584 --> 00:01:01,877
Jembatan juga harus bisa

47
00:01:01,897 --> 00:01:02,670
bergerak.

48
00:01:02,690 --> 00:01:04,300
Panas membuatnya memuai,

49
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,918
dingin membuatnya menyusut.

50
00:01:05,938 --> 00:01:06,940
Bantalan dan sambungan

51
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,519
ekspansi memberi ruang,

52
00:01:08,539 --> 00:01:09,819
pada jenis besar sampai satu

53
00:01:09,839 --> 00:01:10,281
meter.

54
00:01:10,301 --> 00:01:11,597
Jadi jembatan tidak melawan

55
00:01:11,617 --> 00:01:12,108
beban.

56
00:01:12,128 --> 00:01:13,099
Ia mengantarkannya,

57
00:01:13,119 --> 00:01:15,129
dari roda sampai ke tanah.

